WEBVTT

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:04.480
This is AARRKKAA International. Industrial trading, done right.

00:00:09.900 --> 00:00:12.400
When one part fails, the whole line stops.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:16.210
And every hour of downtime costs money. That's where we come in.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.752
Step one. Tell us what you need.

00:00:21.752 --> 00:00:26.388
Send a part number, a drawing, or just a photo, on WhatsApp, phone or email.

00:00:26.388 --> 00:00:28.950
You'll get a quote within one working day.

00:00:31.900 --> 00:00:34.482
Step two. We find the best source.

00:00:34.482 --> 00:00:40.632
We buy genuine parts from manufacturers and trusted sellers, in India and abroad.

00:00:40.632 --> 00:00:45.720
Like SKF from Sweden, FAG and INA from Germany, and NTN from Japan.

00:00:47.800 --> 00:00:49.877
Step three. Trading is what we do.

00:00:49.877 --> 00:00:54.520
We compare sellers and buy in volume, so you pay less than the market price.

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:00.485
Step four.

00:01:00.485 --> 00:01:06.040
Every part is matched to your spec, checked for quality, and packed safely at our Hosur office.

00:01:09.800 --> 00:01:10.456
Step five.

00:01:10.456 --> 00:01:15.837
We deliver by road across India, by air for urgent orders, and by sea for exports.

00:01:15.837 --> 00:01:17.740
Right to your plant, on time.

00:01:21.900 --> 00:01:26.195
Genuine parts. Lower cost. Delivered on time. AARRKKAA International.

00:01:26.195 --> 00:01:28.560
Send us your part, and we'll match it.
